        <!-- ── 06. COMMUNITY BRIEFING ────────────────────────────────── -->
        <section class="site-section community" id="community">
          <div class="community__briefing">
            <div class="section-head">
              <p class="section-kicker">06 // COMMUNITY DISPATCH</p>
              <h2>Follow development and contribute feedback</h2>
            </div>
            <p>
              Commonwealth Online is a working multiplayer framework: dedicated servers, live player sync,
              appearance and gear synchronization, and shared world state are all in place, and Fallout 4 Anniversary Edition (AE),
              Next-Gen (NG), and the original release (OG) are all supported. Combat, quests, NPCs, settlements, voice chat and
              large-server performance are actively in development. DLC, mods and Creation Club content are not required
              unless other players have them. Community feedback and testing interest help shape priorities as systems
              mature.
            </p>
            <div class="community__actions">
